ry":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5\n4.4\netc.\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nTranslation parser for GDScript can parse filter assignment in FileDialog. However it assumes that `add_filter()` is used as `add_filter(\"*.ext;Filter Name\")`, while Filter Name is actually a second parameter, i.e. `add_filter(\"*.ext\", \"Filter Name\")`. Technically both are correct, but using the latter syntax will result in \"Argument for setting FileDialog has bad format.\" and the name not being extracted.\n\nThe relevant code is here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/06827c91c6ee98068a48c66be0cc067ebb434a2f/modules/gdscript/editor/gdscript_translation_parser_plugin.cpp#L385-L389\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use `add_filter()` in GDScript\n2. Generate POT from that script (Project Settings -> Localization -> POT Generation)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111286